  "title": "UniScFlow: public-accession reconstruction and guarded remapping of single-cell RNA-seq raw data",
  "description": "UniScFlow reconstructs selected public scRNA-seq and snRNA-seq deposits from repository metadata and raw-file evidence, prepares auditable mapper inputs, and routes each project to a supported STAR-based mapping workflow or an explicit machine-readable stop.",
